**The inactivity workflow checks a repository's latest activity and sends reminders when it has been inactive for more than 180 days.** The supplied process records reminder counts and can archive the repository after three reminders without a response.

Use [Operations Overview](./index.mdx) to find the other platform maintenance guides.

**Work locations — the approved Bitrise operations workflow and its reminder records.** The authorized platform/repository owner configures this automation for the intended repository.

