## 6. Adopt and verify the published version

The latest process explicitly separates publishing from adoption. The engine or configuration repository adopts the reviewed catalog commit through its approved process.

| Evidence | What to record |
|---|---|
| Published catalog commit | Exact promoted revision. |
| Template ID/version | Workflow version selected by the consumer. |
| Metadata/checksum result | Integrity evidence for the selected definition. |
